eneric"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-03a3d184509c","stem":"Which aspect of plant-based diets contributes to their sustainability? - A) Reduced dependency on fossil fuels - B) Increased reliance on monocultures - C) Higher greenhouse gas emissions - D) Greater water consumption ) Reduced dependency on fossil fuels","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Nutrition and Dietetics","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":true,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Nutrition and Dietetics","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-7d468682f33f","stem":"What is a recommended approach to increase the adoption of plant-based diets in communities? - A) Limiting plant-based food availability - B) Promoting education and accessibility - C) Reducing plant-based food variety - D) Ignoring dietary preferences ) Promoting education and accessibility These questions cover various aspects of plant-based diets as discussed in the WHO document, focusing on health, environmental impact, and sustainability.","type":"Essay / Structured Essay","subject":"Nutrition and Dietetics","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":true,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Nutrition and Dietetics","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-7e804c126a5c","stem":"2.2 Awareness of Pre-Operative Physiotherapy Table 4.1 shows the levels of awareness among surgical doc