he awareness levels regarding post-operative physiotherapy. Table 4.4: Awareness about Post-Operative Physiotherapy Question Frequency (n) Percentage (%) Have you ever heard of post-operative physiotherapy? - No 6","type":"Short Answer","subject":"ENT","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"ENT","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-36762303552c","stem":"2.2 Awareness of Pre-Operative Physiotherapy Table 4.1 shows the levels of awareness among surgical doctors concerning pre-operative physiotherapy. Table 4.1: Awareness about Pre-Operative Physiotherapy Question Frequency (n) Percentage (%) How often have you worked with a physiotherapist? - Never 6 12.00 - Few times 18 36.00 - A lot of times 14 28.00 - Most of the time 12 24.00 Have you ever worked with a physiotherapist in surgical care? - No 2 4.00 - Yes 48 96.00 - Not applicable 0 0.00 Have you ever heard of pre-operative physiotherapy? - No 8 16.00 - Yes 42 84.00 The majority of participants have heard of pre-operative physiotherapy (84%) and have frequently worked with physiotherapists (64% indicated they have worked with physiotherapists a lot or most of the time).","type":"Short Answer","subject":"General Surgery","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"General Surgery","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":["whitespace/page_marker_normalization"]},{"id":"q-b2291e0e0ba9","stem":"2.5 Awareness of Post-Operative Physiotherapy Table 4.4 shows the awareness levels regarding post-operative physiotherapy. Table 4.4: Awareness about Post-Operative Physiotherapy Question Frequency (n) Percentage (%) Have you ever heard of post-operative physiotherapy?","type":"Short Answer","subject":"ENT","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":true,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"ENT","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-7057aa96d9fe","stem":"4 Research question What are the prevalence and risk factors for anaemia among pregnant women attending antenatal care clinics at Mawenzi Regional Hospital? CHAPTER TWO","type":"Short Answer","subject":"ENT","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"ENT","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-8c2424795d6a","stem":"Carroli, G., Rooney, C., & Villar, J. (2001). How effective is antenatal care in preventing maternal mortality and serious morbidity?","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Pediatrics and Child Health","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":true,"needsFigure":false,