a malaria? / Have you had malaria? (Ndiyo/Yes / Hapana/No) (d) Ikiwa ndiyo, ni mara ngapi? / If yes, how many times?","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Obstetrics and Gynecology","topic":"Antenatal Care · Suggested","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":"Antenatal Care","options":[],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Obstetrics and Gynecology","displayTopic":"Antenatal Care · Suggested","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-f827f6acdcef","stem":"CHAKULA / MEALS: Unakula chakula milo mingapi kwa siku? / How many meals do you eat per day?","type":"Short Answer","subject":"ENT","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"ENT","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-79935aa57406","stem":"UPUNGUFU WA DAMU / ANEMIA: Je, ni mambo gani yanachangia upungufu wa damu kwa akinamama wajawazito? / What are the factors that contribute to anemia in pregnant women? (weka alama V/Check the appropriate box) (a) Lishe duni / Poor diet (b) Ugonjwa wa Malaria / Malaria (c) Ugonjwa wa minyoo / Worms (d) Uzazi wa mara kwa mara / Frequent childbearing (e) Sijui / I don't know","type":"Short Answer","subject":"Hematology","topic":"Hematology","topicOriginal":"Hematology","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":[],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Hematology","displayTopi