[]},{"id":"q-cb3295ffa55c","stem":"Changes in gastric PH. Ketoconazole needs acidic environment. When co-administered with proton pump inhibitors the pH will change-what will happen? Addition of acidic fluids/juice- What will happen? Note: total amount absorbed is affected but the rate of absorption is the same","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"General Surgery","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"Managing drug interaction"},{"label":"B","text":"Find alternative if the interaction is potentially decrease drug effect Monitor side effects and therapeutic effect for moderate interaction Arrange for TDM The elderly are at risk of drug interaction Note: interaction can occur with non prescription medicine"},{"label":"C","text":"Rational drug use"},{"label":"D","text":"Introduction It is the use of drugs accordingly Better prescribing Better information Better compliance"},{"label":"E","text":"Rational drug prescribing requirement"},{"label":"F","text":"Medical practitioner Accurate diagnosis Select best drug from the list Adequate dose for sufficient length of time Drug effectiveness"}],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"General Surgery","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-ba17c7247ed9","stem":"Why irrational use","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"General Surgery","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"For a doctor Inadequate training in therapeutics Lack of drug information Heavy patient load Pressure from patients Lack of continuing education"},{"label":"B","text":"Why irrational use"},{"label":"C","text":"For a patient Due to lack of knowledge and advice people make irrational choices Eg. Choose the wrong drug Buy too many or too little consideration of age and concomitant medication (overlooked)"},{"label":"D","text":"conclusion"},{"label":"E","text":"Rational drug use is to ensure Effective form of the correct drug Delivered to the right patient In the prescribed dosage and quantity With clear instructions Packed to maintain potency of the drug."},{"label":"F","text":"THANKS FOR LISTENING"}],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"General Surgery","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["repeated_question_stem","topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[],"duplicateStemGroup":"1109f1a638a9b3d145757b7b9205b8a14a57a851"},{"id":"q-26b86ee6d6ab","stem":"Why irrational use","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"General Surgery","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"For a patient Due to lack of knowledge and advice people make irrational choices Eg. Choose the wrong drug Buy too many or too little consideration of age and concomitant medication (overlooked)"},{"label":"B","text":"conclusion"},{"label":"C","text":"Rational drug use is to ensure Effective form of the correct drug Delivered to the right patient In the prescribed dosage and quantity With clear instructions Packed to maintain potency of the drug."},{"label":"D","text":"THANKS FOR LISTENING"},{"label":"E","text":"EXAMPLE"},{"label":"F","text":"INJ. DICLOFENAC 75MG IM STAT DATE 03 NOV 2022"}],"priority":1,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"General Surgery","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudic